From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Halhadus <eneshakans45@proton.me>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:23:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] ASoC: qcom: q6apm: preserve graph and mapping ownership
 on errors

Serialize graph creation and hostless ownership against media mapping.
Propagate OPEN, STOP and CLOSE failures, retain the final start reference
on failed STOP and block new owners after ambiguous DSP operations.

Validate media reply lengths and fragment tokens. Complete persistent
configuration commands and clear only the acknowledged UNMAP handle.
Drain GPR callbacks before freeing graph fragments and client state.

Signed-off-by: Halhadus <eneshakans45@proton.me>
---
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm.c | 143 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm.h |   5 +-
 2 files changed, 117 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

diff --git a/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm.c b/sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm.c
